      "score": 87,
      "summary": "A clear P0-P3 table separates source evidence from runtime hypotheses. Hardening covers failures, uploads, selection scope and permissions well, and the modal versus nonmodal drawer nuance is good. Its performance gates are thinner and less specific, and fixes do not carry per-finding acceptance conditions. Detector reconciliation and scope honesty are solid."
