      "score": 93,
      "summary": "Each finding comes with evidence, unknowns, repairs and acceptance criteria. It gives a full recovery contract for 401, 403, 409, 429, 500/timeout and offline, and covers stale writes and partial-batch failures. Its performance gates are concrete (INP, long tasks, mounted rows, CLS, memory, regression deltas) and it has explicit rollback and safety-on-rollback rules. It reconciles static signals carefully and avoids redesign. It is long but stays in scope."
